* PMA2-63LN+ and PMA3-83LN+ DC bias behaviour only. Each draws a typical current from its
* output pin once biased, and has no RF model. Use the cascade check for RF.
* Pins: RF out and supply, ground, RF in.
.subckt PMA2_63LN_BIAS out g in
Bid out g I = 0.044 * tanh(max(V(out,g),0) / 1.0)
Rin in g 1G
.ends
.subckt PMA3_83LN_BIAS out g in
Bid out g I = 0.060 * tanh(max(V(out,g),0) / 1.0)
Rin in g 1G
.ends
